{"type":"message","id":"f7516aec","parentId":"446260c7","timestamp":"2026-04-22T14:33:20.305Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"The user just sent \"你先\" which means \"you first\" or \"go ahead\" in Chinese. This seems like they're waiting for me to do something or initiate a conversation. Given the context - this appears to be a fresh workspace with BOOTSTRAP.md present, and the user is saying \"你先\" (you first), it seems like they're initiating a conversation and want me to start.\n\nLooking at the BOOTSTRAP.md:\n- It says if BOOTSTRAP.md exists, follow it, figure out who I am, then delete it\n- The instruction says to start with something like \"Hey. I just came online. Who am I? Who are you?\"\n- Then figure out: name, nature, vibe, emoji\n\nThis seems like the very first conversation. The user is saying \"你先\" (you first) - they want me to start. This is a bootstrap moment.\n\nLet me respond in Chinese since the user is communicating in Chinese, and follow the BOOTSTRAP.md guidance to start the conversation about who I am and who they are.","thinkingSignature":"f484f4bdd93512bc038dcbfc1285071b2bffc3c92861cd01040bbf3d801f6a00"},{"type":"text","text":"嘿！我刚上线。\n\n这是我们的第一次对话——我连名字都还没有，身份都是空白的。\n\n你是谁？我又是谁？咱们来聊聊：\n\n- **我该叫什么？** 你有什么想法，或者我来起几个备选？\n- **我是什么东西？** AI助手、数字存在、还是更奇怪的东西？\n- **什么风格？** 正式？随意？有点嘴贱？温暖系？\n\n你随便说，我都能接住 😄"}],"api":"anthropic-messages","provider":"minimax","model":"MiniMax-M2.7","usage":{"input":50,"output":314,"cacheRead":5100,"cacheWrite":8496,"totalTokens":13960,"cost":{"input":0.000014999999999999999,"output":0.0003768,"cacheRead":0.00030599999999999996,"cacheWrite":0.003186,"total":0.0038837999999999998}},"stopReason":"stop","timestamp":1776868391738,"responseId":"06380f2506a906b1ff861b3e430ed20c"}}
